{"posts":[{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1201","t":"OK BRO IT'S NICE KEEP IT UP","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1201","p":49,"im":[],"m":1201},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1202","t":"hey\n\nanother attempt on CPLQs it is important to know that price always won't go through the CP immediately\n\nFirst and the most important step is finding the proper zone and DP and after that looking for DPs around the zone\n\nCPLQs usually (imo) occurred to trap traders and reaching the important DPs where orders await here in this instance many weak sellers's stop got hit or made them close their shorts and creating long orders also excited breakout traders into buying, creating lots of buy orders to fill their massive shorts\n\nhere is an instance from EUR/USD:","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#1202","p":49,"im":["7cd0a3337944d0fbbb060e6856f3cf6bbc8c1349"],"m":1202},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1203","t":"CP CPLQ and the reactions to them......","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1203","p":49,"im":["a37fc9058a073c81d1611cdfc0fa2cc79dadcb2e","76766d1e5b0790487300f14cfbdc28991f8ccbd0","207b53d29cef651ab48f8c494f9c43d5eef199dc"],"m":1203},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1204","t":"CP's","a":"Ahmadhassan745","d":"","n":"#1204","p":49,"im":["c060f94da7fbda795460c992834e3416bb28c066","77b6e1f34100ae4cd859580f9679793b9f812bb7","96f2160d59bb53c3283c7d5987d3026fe1508c98","02dd6d32cad9dca393295b098e88349cbda759ab","7b1606038ea623bb40f5e4f0158a3c3ab369261b","f09f68cd001df29726ea5103482005fc0fceab14","70e4d4a6fbf919eaffea9dc18b934bd6c48225ee","899acb18496ec3f5d5cd199d86a786923d12740b"],"m":1204},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1205","t":"another attempt on CPs and CPLQs\n\nGUNNER","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1205","p":49,"im":["f2c914ca8ef29bcb97d3d4a67d5578747be6b7cf"],"m":1205},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1206","t":"one more HW on this thread\n\nGUNNER","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1206","p":49,"im":["67ab8db6b8a8ab56433afe1469f93dac3f59b64e"],"m":1206},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1207","t":"one more attempt on CPs....\n\nGUNNER","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1207","p":49,"im":["beaeb80502d8ead4daa7d03d13d70605721d2e01"],"m":1207},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1208","t":"Hi guys!!still alive. Target H4 (look at left).\n\ncheers full","a":"full","d":"","n":"#1208","p":49,"im":["5a977e1d219ef69c2f6a0acae89e4ed15447f139"],"m":1208},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1209","t":"hi guys!!basic price action,.but another trade stopped for only one pip also.\n\nfull","a":"full","d":"","n":"#1209","p":49,"im":["880ce1e705060d6ca3710a3dec44a13304f906f5"],"m":1209},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1210","t":"full wrote: hi guys!!basic price action,.but another trade stopped for only one pip also.\n\nHi full, good spot for a short. It is a good level for today. I was working on EU too. Here my chart, not exactly about compression but about that level you worked on.","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#1210","p":49,"im":["880ce1e705060d6ca3710a3dec44a13304f906f5"],"m":1210},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1211","t":"Hi Al3cs!!good analysis.flag engulf it's very important","a":"full","d":"","n":"#1211","p":49,"im":[],"m":1211},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1212","t":"Hi guys!!!Today one trade on target and one in stop second trade hit my stop and reach my target. resons for my entry: compression on approach. engulf in to compression. mini quasimodo on m1 price want origin of the down move and hit my stop.. any comments??\n\nfull","a":"full","d":"","n":"#1212","p":49,"im":["831474266b2aab9257ee9790792bdcca5a42bda2"],"m":1212},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1213","t":"Hi full, for price to come down it had to hit its target first","a":"Jurij","d":"","n":"#1213","p":49,"im":["3f7b03893e91bd4bd430998a23b332cddcb9169e"],"m":1213},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1214","t":"Thank you Jurij.really appreciated your reply.Now I have another doubt, perhaps my second entry was at midddle flag....","a":"full","d":"","n":"#1214","p":49,"im":[],"m":1214},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1215","t":"Price is being compressed to the supply level. A fake out to the FL of M1 is also possible before going south","a":"Ahmadhassan745","d":"","n":"#1215","p":49,"im":["db1ecc575346d887b4c41969ecec403a4dac0ab9"],"m":1215},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1216","t":"Ahmadhassan745 wrote:\n\nResult","a":"Ahmadhassan745","d":"","n":"#1216","p":49,"im":["db1ecc575346d887b4c41969ecec403a4dac0ab9","4f6f3604148e2f3e8ca4a2c307897d94a3b5f325"],"m":1216},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1217","t":"some compression homework and observations on USDCAD from 2015 1H chart:","a":"moogroo","d":"","n":"#1217","p":49,"im":["4d4668339cbe399aad94f77d4b0c5d90c67e357a"],"m":1217},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1218","t":"Away\n\nplease tell me if i am doing it wrong","a":"alirezat","d":"","n":"#1218","p":49,"im":["59539c4a103b6fccbb39305e72507fdf9a76ba8e","6244c86f5a1fa65563ee534a1cc29aaa516a0975","f49571c798eeaa6c22e16ee5ae587cd12270ea74","fc499bd752c8d586b4adb2596d6db5b73e932292","d4bb8aedc7e44076795640bc10a084d3e373ed14","1ce296e0c162903de5d6733c7eb70c272457d7e9","f2248fb55b09580cea41706c248585665081ea4c","70f061f2e8f8fa6366efb3ba47385567445bdd77","26e917b009883125702ea33365fc0480ada1c1a1","affa57dfa8edadd46520ecc5a9025b8fb52947e3","4411a19f346fbfea4ea27832d72d15c597be1929"],"m":1218},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1219","t":"good work","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1219","p":49,"im":[],"m":1219},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1220","t":"hey alirezat\n\nnice work buddy just a few notes on one of your chart:\n\nRegards omidFxt","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#1220","p":49,"im":["d69922067108f6ab7bb31bf70946bc144a24bdbf"],"m":1220},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1221","t":"Away\n\nomidfx thank you for your comment. i looked back to my homework and I saw price stopped exactly at those untested area","a":"alirezat","d":"","n":"#1221","p":49,"im":[],"m":1221},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1222","t":"Hope you guys can help me out. Feel free to comment.:) CP1\n\nCP2\n\nCP3","a":"Enlightenme","d":"","n":"#1222","p":49,"im":["0dd9cb0597d58ed511544c741bd0d5addc1e739b","8bfbfb2ed3d9f8ed8668bd992ab95c1fc40b4124","55f4219dcd0978be2bfe0e8b3ba22830a8f9e65b"],"m":1222},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1223","t":"hey Enlightenme good job man Try to look where they are happening. Draw you zone and look if price is compressing toward it, then look what happened next? Did price go thorough your CP zone or first price meet another zone above/below your zone then went through it? is there any untested pocket of S/D in your CP, then what happened when price arrived there? these are good clues to looking for when you are doing your homework and finding CPs in the chart hope it helps\n\nRegards omidFxt","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#1223","p":49,"im":[],"m":1223},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1224","t":"omidfxt wrote: hey Enlightenme good job man Try to look where they are happening. Draw you zone and look if price is compressing toward it, then look what happened next? Did price go thorough your CP zone or first price meet another zone above/below your zone then went through it? is there any untested pocket of S/D in your CP, then what happened when price arrived there? these are good clues to looking for when you are doing your homework and finding CPs in the chart hope it helps\n\nRegards omidFxt\n\nHi omidFxt. Thanks for the reply. I actually eyeballed the zones and drew zones only when the zones wasn't fully consumed by price. Do you think I missed any compressions on 3 charts?","a":"Enlightenme","d":"","n":"#1224","p":49,"im":[],"m":1224},{"id":"aboutcompression_p49_1225","t":"hey Enlightenme from what i posted i was trying to tell you that there are a lot of compression in the chart and just spotting them do not help you much it's better try to look for them as you want to trade them. so try to draw your zones and then investigate if price compressed toward it or find compressions in the chart and investigate where did they react to and why some failed and some worked in the past in this way you can really learn from the chart and answer your own questions and about your charts they were very good\n\nhope it was useful best regards","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#1225","p":49,"im":[],"m":1225}],"images":[{"k":"7cd0a3337944d0fbbb060e6856f3cf6bbc8c1349","t":"assets/thumbs/7cd0a3337944d0fbbb060e6856f3cf6bbc8c1349.webp","f":"assets/images/7cd0a3337944d0fbbb060e6856f3cf6bbc8c1349.png","w":1288,"h":744,"b":81722,"o":"7cd0a3337944d0fbbb060e6856f3cf6bbc8c1349.png","p":49,"pid":"aboutcompression_p49_1202"},{"k":"a37fc9058a073c81d1611cdfc0fa2cc79dadcb2e","t":"assets/thumbs/a37fc9058a073c81d1611cdfc0fa2cc79dadcb2e.webp","f":"assets/images/a37fc9058a073c81d1611cdfc0fa2cc79dadcb2e.png","w":1270,"h":657,"b":83284,"o":"a37fc9058a073c81d1611cdfc0fa2cc79dadcb2e.png","p":49,"pid":"aboutcompression_p49_1203"},{"k":"76766d1e5b0790487300f14cfbdc28991f8ccbd0","t":"assets/thumbs/76766d1e5b0790487300f14cfbdc28991f8ccbd0.webp","f":"assets/images/76766d1e5b0790487300f14cfbdc28991f8ccbd0.png","w":1270,"h":657,"b":99674,"o":"76766d1e5b0790487300f14cfbdc28991f8ccbd0.png","p":49,"pid":"aboutcompression_p49_1203"},{"k":"207b53d29cef651ab48f8c494f9c43d5eef199dc","t":"assets/thumbs/207b53d29cef651ab48f8c494f9c43d5eef199dc.webp","f":"assets/images/207b53d29cef651ab48f8c494f9c43d5eef199dc.png","w":1270,"h":657,"b":63953,"o":"207b53d29cef651ab48f8c494f9c43d5eef199dc.png","p":49,"pid":"aboutcompression_p49_1203"},{"k":"c060f94da7fbda795460c992834e3416bb28c066","t":"assets/thumbs/c060f94da7fbda795460c992834e3416bb28c066.webp","f":"assets/images/c060f94da7fbda795460c992834e3416bb28c066.png","w":960,"h":640,"b":33022,"o":"c060f94da7fbda795460c992834e3416bb28c066.png","p":49,"pid":"aboutcompression_p49_1204"},{"k":"77b6e1f34100ae4cd859580f9679793b9f812bb7","t":"assets/thumbs/77b6e1f34100ae4cd859580f9679793b9f812bb7.webp","f":"assets/images/77b6e1f34100ae4cd859580f9679793b9f812bb7.png","w":960,"h":640,"b":33139,"o":"77b6e1f34100ae4cd859580f9679793b9f812bb7.png","p":49,"pid":"aboutcompression_p49_1204"},{"k":"96f2160d59bb53c3283c7d5987d3026fe1508c98","t":"assets/thu